# ORI crease pattern - the preliminary (square) base, as folded flat:
# one half of a book-fold line reverses, so the centre has 5 valleys and
# 3 mountains (Maekawa: |M - V| = 2).
# paper x y x y ...      paper outline (in order)
# M|V|A x1 y1 x2 y2      mountain / valley / auxiliary crease
name Preliminary base
grid 50
paper 0 0  400 0  400 400  0 400
V 0 0 400 400
V 400 0 0 400
M 0 200 400 200
M 200 0 200 200
V 200 200 200 400
